1
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:01,333
What if Earth stopped—

2
00:00:01,567 --> 00:00:02,267
right now?

3
00:00:02,733 --> 00:00:04,133
This street was moving east

4
00:00:04,133 --> 00:00:06,033
at about a thousand miles an hour.

5
00:00:06,133 --> 00:00:07,500
So was everything on it.

6
00:00:07,633 --> 00:00:08,533
You can’t feel it,

7
00:00:08,567 --> 00:00:10,100
because it all moves together.

8
00:00:10,367 --> 00:00:11,467
Stop the ground,

9
00:00:11,467 --> 00:00:12,800
and anything that isn’t fixed

10
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:14,200
to it keeps going.

11
00:00:14,367 --> 00:00:16,267
At first, the air keeps going.

12
00:00:16,333 --> 00:00:17,633
So does the ocean.

13
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:19,000
Farther from the equator,

14
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:19,867
it’s slower—

15
00:00:19,933 --> 00:00:21,667
but even at eighty degrees north,

16
00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,267
it starts at Category five

17
00:00:23,267 --> 00:00:24,400
hurricane speed.

18
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,300
None of this can really happen.

19
00:00:26,433 --> 00:00:28,200
But the motion is real.

20
00:00:28,333 --> 00:00:29,333
At the equator,

21
00:00:29,333 --> 00:00:30,333
her coffee’s been moving

22
00:00:30,333 --> 00:00:32,700
about a thousand miles an hour all along.

23
00:00:32,867 --> 00:00:33,967
It just never spilled.

